# Crusaders ANPR Trajectory Intelligence — Environment Configuration

# Deployed Backend Base URL (for HTTP REST API)
# Example: https://crusaders-anpr.onrender.com or http://127.0.0.1:8000
VITE_API_URL=https://crusaders-anpr.onrender.com

# Dedicated WebSocket Endpoint (Bypasses Vercel serverless limitations)
# Example: wss://crusaders-anpr.onrender.com/ws or ws://127.0.0.1:8000/ws
VITE_WS_URL=wss://crusaders-anpr.onrender.com/ws
